Changes by date
===============

=20261106=
* Converted the GUI from XForms to GTK 3
* Replaced autoconf with a plain Makefile (Linux only)
* Fixed a buffer overflow that crashed the planet census
* Fixed reading numbers into 64-bit variables in parse.c and feconfig.c
  (counts loaded from .fe files and server reports could be garbage)
* Builds with no compiler warnings: fixed the remaining printf formats,
  report failures to enter the database directory or to create the
  sector bitmap (a short bitmap file used to crash ImpFE), and bounded
  the file name and command buffers
=20150706=
bumped max players to 254
=20150530=
* Added man page
